{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/24700","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/24700/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/24700/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/24700/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/24700","id":1235399011,"node_id":"I_kwDOBBJcqc5JorFj","number":24700,"title":"vcpkg_extract_source_archive fails on macOS when build tree is open in the finder","user":{"login":"robertkearns","id":52675269,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNjc1MjY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52675269?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertkearns","html_url":"https://github.com/robertkearns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertkearns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertkearns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertkearns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertkearns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertkearns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertkearns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertkearns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertkearns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertkearns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":453053596,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0NTMwNTM1OTY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/labels/category:vcpkg-bug","name":"category:vcpkg-bug","color":"ff3333","default":false,"description":"The issue is with the vcpkg system (including helper scripts in `scripts/cmake/`)"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"LilyWangLL","id":94091114,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZu3ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94091114?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL","html_url":"https://github.com/LilyWangLL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"LilyWangLL","id":94091114,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZu3ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94091114?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL","html_url":"https://github.com/LilyWangLL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LilyWangLL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2022-05-13T15:33:33Z","updated_at":"2022-05-16T19:40:12Z","closed_at":"2022-05-16T19:40:12Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nWhen vcpkg is extracting the source on macOS the temporary extraction directory is checked to ensure only 1 file exists, and that it is a directory. If the build tree is opened in the finder the finder often creates a .DS_STORE file in the temp directory. This causes the build to fail, as a `.DS_STORE` file exists alongside the extracted source directory.\r\n\r\nThe build fails with:\r\n```\r\nCMake Error at scripts/cmake/vcpkg_extract_source_archive.cmake:225 (message):\r\n  Could not unwrap top level directory from archive.  Pass\r\n  NO_REMOVE_ONE_LEVEL to disable this.\r\nCall Stack (most recent call first):\r\n  scripts/cmake/vcpkg_extract_source_archive_ex.cmake:32 (vcpkg_extract_source_archive)\r\n  ports/qt5-base/cmake/qt_download_submodule.cmake:32 (vcpkg_extract_source_archive_ex)\r\n  ports/qt5-base/portfile.cmake:72 (qt_download_submodule)\r\n  scripts/ports.cmake:146 (include)\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Environment**\r\n- macOS\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nI noticed this while trying to install qt5-base, but its likely any port which uses the CMake function vcpkg_extract_source_archive would have the same issue. It does not always happen.\r\n\r\n1. Open the vcpkg build tree directory in the finder (`<vcpkgRoot>/buildtrees`)\r\n2. Run `vcpkg install qt5-base`\r\n\r\nIf you add `message(\"Temp directory: '${temp_dir}' Archive Dir: ${archive_directory}\")` to line 221 of `scripts/cmake/vcpkg_extract_source_archive.cmake` and rerun the above steps, its evident that a `.DS_STORE` file is shown in the resulting glob.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"BillyONeal","id":1544943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDQ5NDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1544943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal","html_url":"https://github.com/BillyONeal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BillyONeal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/24700/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/24700/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}